# HDR-OUTPUT: Mac EDR output (scRGB linear) as UE r.HDR.*; Display.Output in machine.json (Scalability panel -> Display, palette group "Display").
# Logs to read in editor.log: "[Display] output ...", "[Display] OS: ... EDR headroom ...", "[Display] capture of the scRGB swapchain ...".
# B16_Bistro_Street live: run_capped killed the editor (resident 6516 MB > cap 6144 MB) while loading — reported; the
# proof runs on the Desert project's Starter scene (sunlit sand + sky + sun disc: highlights above paper white).
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Display "Display: Output SDR_sRGB"
Тогда 1_sdr кадр как до задачи (SDR-захват не изменился); editor.log "[Display] output SDR (sRGB): format BGRA8_UNORM colour space SRGB_NONLINEAR"
Когда run Display "Display: Output scRGB_Linear"
Тогда 2_edr editor.log output scRGB linear (EDR): RGBA16F + EXTENDED_SRGB_LINEAR, OS EDR headroom > 1, paper white / peak in nits; capture peak > 1.0 x paper white (sun stone); PNG (SDR rendition) matches 1_sdr; UI at paper white
Когда run Display "Display: Output SDR_sRGB"
Тогда 3_sdr_back SDR again, same as 1_sdr (machine.json left at SDR)
